WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:03.587
Do you know
who you welcomed into your home?

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:13.597
Leanne? Leanne Grayson?

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.098
Hello, Mrs. Turner.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:19.144
-Hi. I'm Sean.
-Pleased to meet you, Mr. Turner.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.065
You have a beautiful home.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.860
She is a godsend.

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:30.280
I was expecting someone... older.
Less weird.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:33.659
We hope you'll treat our house
as your home.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:38.247
I'm sure you and Jericho
will form an instant bond.

00:00:41.959 --> 00:00:43.085
She's cool with everything?

00:00:43.836 --> 00:00:45.003
She knows the situation?

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.474
I guess we should talk about this.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:01.061
She's gone. You can put the doll down now.

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:03.438
I'm fine as I am, Mr. Turner.

00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:07.609
We lost Jericho when he was 13 weeks.
Dorothy took it hard.

00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:09.611
This is the only thing
that brought her back.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:12.865
I should take Jericho for his walk now.

00:01:17.661 --> 00:01:19.371
You hired a nanny? For a doll?

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.749
Where did you find her?

00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:28.463
She is wonderful with Jericho.
And if my baby trusts her, so do I.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:34.094
How much did those boys tell you
about what happened?

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:37.514
What if she wakes up?

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:41.226
What if she remembers?

00:01:54.364 --> 00:01:55.699
Do you know..

00:01:57.409 --> 00:01:59.953
who you welcomed into your home?

